SUMMARY:Hands on Impact: Women's Lunch Place | Session I
LOCATION:Offsite: Women's Lunch Place
DESCRIPTION:Category: ‘Quin Impact Fund\nPrice: Free / Included\nStatus: 
 unlimited\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/192033\n\nJo
 in fellow members for a meaningful day of service at Women's Lunch Place\,
  a safe and welcoming daytime shelter and advocacy center supporting women
  experiencing hunger\, homelessness\, and poverty. Volunteers will assist 
 in the organization's kitchen\, helping prepare and serve nutritious meals
  while supporting daily operations that make a direct impact on guests' li
 ves.\n\nVolunteer activities may include meal preparation\, kitchen organi
 zation\, unpacking deliveries\, preparing to-go meals\, and other essentia
 l tasks. This opportunity offers a unique chance to learn more about Women
 's Lunch Place\, connect with staff and guests\, and contribute to an orga
 nization centered on dignity\, hope\, and healing.\n\n*This event is compl
 imentary and reserved for members only. Please wear closed-toe shoes\, lon
 g pants\, and a shirt with sleeves. Hair must be pulled back and covered w
 ith a hat or hairnet (provided on-site if needed).
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/192033
CATEGORIES:‘Quin Impact Fund
END:VEVENT
