SUMMARY:Serendipity Dinner - Shared Histories
LOCATION:The Muse
DESCRIPTION:Category: Member Mixer\nPrice: Free / Included\nStatus: Waitlis
 t Only\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/194060\n\nConti
 nuing the "Curated Connections" extension of the Serendipity series\, join
  us for dinner convening members who study\, preserve\, teach\, or simply 
 delight in history. From historians\, educators\, archivists\, curators\, 
 and authors to lifelong learners and passionate history enthusiasts\, this
  month's shared interest will inspire engaging conversation as you engage 
 with fellow members through conversations inspired by the people\, places\
 , and pivotal moments that have shaped our world.\n\nCurious? Set against 
 the backdrop of a thoughtfully curated three-course dinner with expertly p
 aired wines\, this unique experience invites members to connect through cu
 rated conversation prompts designed to spark engaging dialogue. Enjoy the 
 perfect blend of stimulating discussion\, exceptional company\, and a menu
  crafted to delight the senses. \n\n*Tickets are $100 per person\, plus t
 ax and are reserved for members only. Cancellations within 72 hours of the
  event\, or failure to attend\, will be charged in full. Please inform us 
 of any dietary needs or restrictions by emailing happening@thequin.com at 
 least 72 hours before dinner service.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/194060
CATEGORIES:Member Mixer
END:VEVENT
